WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.260
Episode 32

01:28.280 --> 01:30.220
(Peace and Prosperity)
She's well-informed.

01:30.240 --> 01:32.090
The Grand Princess will soon receive the news

01:32.110 --> 01:34.240
that Princess Fuqing can see again.

01:34.470 --> 01:37.290
What are you going to tell her?

01:37.310 --> 01:38.910
Rest assured, Saintess.

01:38.950 --> 01:40.430
I know what to say.

01:43.280 --> 01:44.880
I have a question.

01:45.310 --> 01:46.750
Was my mother,

01:47.870 --> 01:49.080
Earl Dongping's wife,

01:49.080 --> 01:50.520
Su Ke,

01:52.160 --> 01:53.800
killed by you?

02:00.480 --> 02:02.270
The Grand Princess killed her

02:02.640 --> 02:04.640
with the Slumber Flower from Nanwu.

02:08.080 --> 02:12.600
(Peace and Prosperity)

02:13.550 --> 02:14.990
Wait, Your Highness.

02:15.200 --> 02:16.930
Your eyes have just recovered.

02:16.950 --> 02:18.250
They should avoid bright light.

02:18.270 --> 02:20.180
Wait a few more days to take it off.

02:21.320 --> 02:22.760
Ms. Hua,

02:23.230 --> 02:25.550
I'd like some space, please.

02:25.990 --> 02:27.430
Yes.

02:46.710 --> 02:48.400
What about Princess Fuqing?

02:49.080 --> 02:51.080
Back then, she was a little girl.

02:51.990 --> 02:54.030
Why poison her?

02:55.760 --> 02:58.920
She knew the Grand Princess's scheme.

03:10.520 --> 03:16.230
(Peace and Prosperity)

03:16.240 --> 03:19.020
Go back and rest, Your Highness.

03:19.040 --> 03:20.700
Your eyes are fine now.

03:20.720 --> 03:22.180
You'll have plenty of time

03:22.200 --> 03:23.760
to see everything.

03:24.320 --> 03:26.280
If I don't see it now,

03:26.600 --> 03:27.720
what if I...?

03:27.720 --> 03:29.100
It won't happen.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.560
Don't be afraid.

03:32.680 --> 03:34.160
Your Highness,

03:35.200 --> 03:37.260
I can cure your eye disease

03:37.280 --> 03:39.240
but not your fear.

03:39.800 --> 03:42.040
You can only overcome it yourself.

03:42.560 --> 03:44.600
To get rid of nightmares,

03:44.960 --> 03:47.280
we have to be brave and face the truth.

03:49.120 --> 03:52.400
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

03:53.120 --> 03:55.320
What did you do?

03:55.360 --> 03:58.180
Why is Jiang Si still alive?

03:58.200 --> 03:59.880
I'm sorry, Your Highness.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.660
Just when my plan was

04:01.680 --> 04:03.060
about to succeed,

04:03.080 --> 04:04.280
His Majesty and Prince Yan

04:04.280 --> 04:05.700
came to the Changning Palace.

04:05.720 --> 04:07.180
Had I proceeded with it,

04:07.200 --> 04:08.620
they would've got suspicious.

04:08.640 --> 04:10.900
I've had you work for me for so long

04:10.920 --> 04:13.840
because you can get things done neatly.

04:14.480 --> 04:16.520
But this time, you failed

04:16.680 --> 04:20.160
while Jiang Si recognized the Mang Worm

04:20.320 --> 04:21.920
and helped Fuqing recover her eyesight.

04:21.920 --> 04:24.200
How was that possible?

04:24.280 --> 04:25.900
Don't worry, Your Highness.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.740
Prince Yan must've learned

04:27.760 --> 04:29.920
some skills from Nanwu in the South,

04:30.000 --> 04:32.200
which cured Princess Fuqing.

04:32.280 --> 04:33.640
They told His Majesty that they had

04:33.640 --> 04:35.240
found a folk prescription.

04:35.440 --> 04:37.500
They didn't mention anything about Nanwu.

04:37.520 --> 04:39.080
In that case,

04:39.640 --> 04:41.780
they didn't suspect you?

04:41.800 --> 04:43.240
No.

04:43.440 --> 04:46.200
Mother, Si is right.

04:46.320 --> 04:48.180
If I refuse to face the truth,

04:48.200 --> 04:50.100
even if I can see again,

04:50.120 --> 04:51.620
I'll still be shadowed

04:51.640 --> 04:53.240
by fear.

04:53.440 --> 04:54.880
Mother,

04:55.280 --> 04:56.920
my blindness

04:57.120 --> 04:59.240
was man-made!

05:01.080 --> 05:02.460
Really?

05:02.480 --> 05:04.320
What happened?

05:05.040 --> 05:07.100
I saw something

05:07.120 --> 05:08.920
I shouldn't have.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.900
(13th Year of Jingming)
I was locked in a closet

05:11.920 --> 05:13.340
when playing hide-and-seek.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.180
Empress Qingrong

05:15.200 --> 05:17.640
acts against me in everything.

05:17.840 --> 05:19.800
She even talked wildly

05:20.080 --> 05:23.500
that I'd better move out of Ling'an.

05:23.520 --> 05:25.920
Once the Crown Prince ascended the throne,

05:26.320 --> 05:29.880
it'd be too late for me to leave.

05:32.080 --> 05:33.680
Alright then.

05:34.400 --> 05:35.560
I'll make sure

05:35.560 --> 05:37.660
she won't make it to that day

05:37.680 --> 05:41.100
or be buried in the Imperial Mausoleum.

05:41.120 --> 05:43.320
Are you sure the poison you said

05:43.440 --> 05:45.140
can make people look like

05:45.160 --> 05:47.480
they die of leprosy?

05:47.840 --> 05:49.020
Yes.

05:49.040 --> 05:50.480
Good.

05:50.960 --> 05:54.080
When others are up there tonight
for the Chongyang Festival,

05:54.160 --> 05:55.920
you slip in the poison.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.100
Fuqing,

06:25.120 --> 06:27.660
what did you just see?

06:27.680 --> 06:29.300
Did you hear anything?

06:29.320 --> 06:32.020
I... I fell asleep.

06:32.040 --> 06:35.040
I didn't hear or see anything.

06:35.680 --> 06:37.680
Good girl.

06:38.240 --> 06:40.120
Aren't you a sweetie?

06:40.240 --> 06:41.440
I wish Mingyue

06:41.440 --> 06:43.560
could be as good as you.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.380
Tonight, your father

06:45.400 --> 06:48.040
will fly a lantern from the Zhengyang Tower.

06:48.240 --> 06:50.320
Come on. Let's go and look.

06:50.360 --> 06:52.220
I... I'm not going.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.860
I want my mother.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.940
She's on the way.

06:55.960 --> 06:58.000
You'll see her in a moment.

06:59.880 --> 07:01.080
A good girl like you deserves

07:01.080 --> 07:02.600
a reward.

07:03.360 --> 07:04.540
Do you want your mother

07:04.560 --> 07:06.680
to be the new Empress?

07:13.120 --> 07:14.880
Fuqing, come here.

07:23.520 --> 07:25.260
May Dazhou be blessed

07:25.280 --> 07:28.340
with good weather, peace, and prosperity.

07:28.360 --> 07:30.000
May Dazhou be blessed

07:30.000 --> 07:33.800
with good weather, peace, and prosperity.

07:34.200 --> 07:35.960
So that's why I was appointed

07:35.960 --> 07:37.760
empress.

07:41.800 --> 07:45.360
I thought His Majesty chose me

07:45.400 --> 07:47.400
because of your condition.

07:48.000 --> 07:49.380
Being the Empress

07:49.400 --> 07:51.320
or the head of the harem

07:51.840 --> 07:53.520
means nothing to me.

07:53.960 --> 07:56.100
I'd rather see you

07:56.120 --> 07:57.460
forever safe

07:57.480 --> 07:59.220
and healthy.

07:59.240 --> 08:01.700
Don't blame yourself, Mother.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.560
The one who harmed me

08:02.560 --> 08:04.300
was Grand Princess Rongyang.

08:04.320 --> 08:05.980
You're her niece.

08:06.000 --> 08:08.240
How could she be so heartless?

08:08.320 --> 08:09.760
Your Highess,

08:10.600 --> 08:11.640
she's not half as kind

08:11.640 --> 08:13.060
as you.

08:13.080 --> 08:15.720
She harmed not only Fuqing

08:16.080 --> 08:17.520
but also me.

08:17.880 --> 08:19.860
To prevent Cui Xu from being punished

08:19.880 --> 08:21.740
and my mother from being promoted,

08:21.760 --> 08:22.840
she had those of Astronomy

08:22.840 --> 08:24.700
paint me as a cursed prince.

08:24.720 --> 08:26.180
Right after I was born,

08:26.200 --> 08:27.360
I was sent away to the South.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.540
What?

08:28.560 --> 08:30.660
She even dared frame a prince?

08:30.680 --> 08:32.700
How wildly audacious!

08:32.720 --> 08:35.640
I shouldn't have listened to you

08:35.840 --> 08:37.940
to be lenient.

08:37.960 --> 08:41.000
Instead of killing that girl,

08:41.120 --> 08:43.760
I simply ruined her eyes,

08:44.120 --> 08:45.640
but I also made her mother

08:45.640 --> 08:47.080
the Empress

08:47.080 --> 08:49.020
as compensation.

08:49.040 --> 08:50.600
But now,

08:51.040 --> 08:52.620
they might bite the hand

08:52.640 --> 08:54.720
that feeds them.

08:54.760 --> 08:57.520
If that girl lets out

08:57.520 --> 08:59.180
what I did...

08:59.200 --> 09:00.540
Your Highness,

09:00.560 --> 09:03.000
Empress Qingrong died years ago.

09:03.360 --> 09:04.540
Besides,

09:04.560 --> 09:05.440
who'd believe

09:05.440 --> 09:07.560
what a blind girl saw?

09:07.960 --> 09:09.000
Isn't that why

09:09.000 --> 09:11.180
she was blinded in the first place?

09:11.200 --> 09:13.520
I've served Empress Di for decades.

09:13.720 --> 09:15.600
I know her all too well.

09:15.800 --> 09:18.360
Had she known the truth back then,

09:18.480 --> 09:19.860
she would've

09:19.880 --> 09:22.000
had her daughter suffer in silence.

09:22.640 --> 09:25.720
Between blindness and death,

09:25.760 --> 09:27.760
she knew what to choose.

09:28.960 --> 09:31.360
But things have changed.

09:32.400 --> 09:34.520
However weak she is,

09:34.600 --> 09:36.900
she's been the Empress for so long.

09:36.920 --> 09:38.360
Power

09:39.200 --> 09:41.320
changes people the most,

09:41.640 --> 09:44.200
making them forget who they are.

09:44.920 --> 09:46.300
Compare her

09:46.320 --> 09:48.080
with the late empress

09:48.080 --> 09:49.520
at her peak,

09:50.040 --> 09:51.640
is she any better?

09:52.200 --> 09:53.640
You're right.

09:55.360 --> 09:58.360
I lost my head for the moment.

09:58.560 --> 10:00.960
I'll show them

10:01.520 --> 10:05.000
who my brother cherishes

10:05.560 --> 10:08.680
and trusts the most.

10:08.720 --> 10:11.520
The Empress, Yu Jin?

10:12.120 --> 10:14.680
They're worthless!

10:15.080 --> 10:16.500
We must stop the Grand Princess

10:16.520 --> 10:17.920
from wreaking havoc in the harem

10:17.920 --> 10:19.060
and harming the innocent.

10:19.080 --> 10:19.960
If we report her

10:19.960 --> 10:21.200
to His Majesty together

10:21.200 --> 10:23.340
and reinvestigate the late Empress's death,

10:23.360 --> 10:25.580
the Crown Prince will no longer support her.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.180
Only if she's brought to justice

10:27.200 --> 10:28.200
will Princess Fuqing

10:28.200 --> 10:29.860
find security and be freed

10:29.880 --> 10:31.760
from nightmares.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.160
No.

10:33.160 --> 10:34.000
Mother!

10:34.000 --> 10:35.480
Fuqing was blind for 10 years!

10:35.480 --> 10:37.360
Are you going to let it slide?

10:41.360 --> 10:43.880
As long as she's safe,

10:44.680 --> 10:46.600
I'll swallow it.

10:47.440 --> 10:50.560
When the late Empress fought her

10:50.600 --> 10:52.800
with the Crown Prince's help,

10:54.040 --> 10:56.360
did she win?

10:57.040 --> 10:58.960
Such a powerful woman

10:59.200 --> 11:01.000
died a horrible death.

11:01.200 --> 11:02.800
I've lived in the Palace

11:02.800 --> 11:04.460
for so long.

11:04.480 --> 11:06.800
I might not be capable,

11:07.680 --> 11:08.760
but I'm certain

11:08.760 --> 11:11.000
about one thing.

11:11.560 --> 11:14.040
That is the Grand Princess

11:14.240 --> 11:16.720
is special to His Majesty.

11:17.000 --> 11:19.500
Although they aren't of the same mother,

11:19.520 --> 11:21.900
they grew up together

11:21.920 --> 11:23.860
through thick and thin.

11:23.880 --> 11:25.360
When Prince Xiang rebelled,

11:25.360 --> 11:26.940
she guarded the state

11:26.960 --> 11:28.080
and risked her life

11:28.080 --> 11:30.000
to save His Majesty.

11:30.680 --> 11:32.520
Put Fuqing aside.

11:32.640 --> 11:35.100
Even the Crown Prince and Prince Qi

11:35.120 --> 11:37.040
aren't as important as her

11:37.040 --> 11:38.720
to His Majesty.

11:39.360 --> 11:41.380
It's better to swallow it

11:41.400 --> 11:43.140
if it's not life-and-death.

11:43.160 --> 11:45.140
Once you get married

11:45.160 --> 11:46.860
and have children,

11:46.880 --> 11:48.940
live your life and look after your family.

11:48.960 --> 11:49.880
Don't challenge her.

11:49.880 --> 11:50.800
But Your Highness...

11:50.800 --> 11:52.500
We understand your concern,

11:52.520 --> 11:53.960
Your Highess.

11:58.640 --> 12:00.080
Mother!

12:01.920 --> 12:03.220
Did you hear

12:03.240 --> 12:04.940
that Jiang Si had found a folk prescription

12:04.960 --> 12:07.200
and cured Princess Fuqing's eye disease?

12:07.400 --> 12:09.400
She was blind for so long,

12:09.680 --> 12:10.560
and now, my uncle

12:10.560 --> 12:12.240
will favor her even more!

12:12.640 --> 12:15.440
Do you have other ways to change his mind?

12:15.480 --> 12:17.680
Am I not able to marry Yu Jin?

12:19.920 --> 12:21.600
If I can't marry him,

12:22.400 --> 12:23.620
I'd rather die!

12:23.640 --> 12:25.320
Is he all you care about?

12:25.760 --> 12:27.000
Do you even remember

12:27.000 --> 12:28.640
my birthday is coming?

12:35.700 --> 12:37.280
I...

12:39.760 --> 12:40.760
Uncle

12:40.760 --> 12:41.640
comes every year

12:41.640 --> 12:43.280
to celebrate it with you.

12:44.400 --> 12:46.880
I've never bagged anyone,

12:47.360 --> 12:48.920
not even your uncle,

12:50.440 --> 12:52.960
but this time, I'll do it for you.

12:53.360 --> 12:54.800
Thank you, Mother.

12:59.520 --> 13:00.760
Bringing down the Grand Princess

13:00.760 --> 13:02.900
once and for all

13:02.920 --> 13:04.580
isn't as easy as I thought.

13:04.600 --> 13:07.800
Had I not been made in front of Ms. Duo,

13:08.000 --> 13:09.120
we wouldn't have had to

13:09.120 --> 13:10.420
walk on eggs like this.

13:10.440 --> 13:12.580
You've done well enough.

13:12.600 --> 13:14.040
Don't beat yourself up.

13:14.720 --> 13:16.500
Given Her Highness's attitude,

13:16.520 --> 13:17.400
even if we

13:17.400 --> 13:18.880
handed Ms. Duo to her

13:18.880 --> 13:20.340
on a plate,

13:20.360 --> 13:22.720
she wouldn't fight the Grand Princess.

13:23.040 --> 13:25.840
But someone has to take the first step.

13:25.880 --> 13:29.400
Something has to be done.

13:29.880 --> 13:32.100
I agree with one thing

13:32.120 --> 13:34.440
she said, though.

13:34.640 --> 13:35.600
What was it?

13:35.600 --> 13:38.080
Live our life and look after our family.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.080
We can't think about

13:39.080 --> 13:40.950
fighting the Grand Princess all day

13:41.040 --> 13:42.700
and forget about our wedding.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.160
The Rites Office is

13:44.160 --> 13:45.700
preparing everything.

13:45.720 --> 13:47.420
They've done it more than once.

13:47.440 --> 13:48.480
Do we have to

13:48.480 --> 13:49.820
work on it ourselves?

13:49.840 --> 13:51.040
Have you learned the etiquette?

13:51.040 --> 13:53.000
Isn't that a mere formality?

13:53.020 --> 13:53.920
Besides,

13:53.920 --> 13:55.000
if I get down to it,

13:55.000 --> 13:56.580
I'll master everything in no time.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.080
Have you tried the gown?

13:59.560 --> 14:00.520
No.

14:00.520 --> 14:02.400
Have you checked the furnishings?

14:02.440 --> 14:04.580
You'll be the mistress of our mansion.

14:04.600 --> 14:07.640
Do I have to check them myself?

14:08.160 --> 14:09.480
The mansion looks

14:09.480 --> 14:10.440
good enough as it is.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.320
Do you need to ask?

14:11.320 --> 14:13.200
Clearly, you're being lazy.

14:13.920 --> 14:15.920
This is our wedding.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.240
It's the biggest event

14:17.240 --> 14:19.300
in our life.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.360
I have to make sure

14:20.360 --> 14:22.320
you like everything in our mansion,

14:22.400 --> 14:24.180
the food to be served at the wedding,

14:24.200 --> 14:26.640
and the wedding gown you'll be wearing.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.300
But most importantly,

14:28.320 --> 14:31.560
I love the man I'm going to marry.

14:36.120 --> 14:38.200
(Crown Prince's Mansion)

14:38.200 --> 14:39.540
Your Highness,

14:39.560 --> 14:40.560
I copied the Vajra Sutra

14:40.560 --> 14:41.800
after being on a vegetarian diet

14:41.800 --> 14:43.280
for three days.

14:43.920 --> 14:46.060
It's the thought that matters
for her birthday.

14:46.080 --> 14:48.300
(Vajra Sutra)
Sutra?

14:48.320 --> 14:49.320
Aunt's never

14:49.320 --> 14:50.580
into Buddhism.

14:50.600 --> 14:51.740
I don't think

14:51.760 --> 14:53.840
this gift is to her taste.

14:54.880 --> 14:56.260
Take a look at this.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.820
The Tree of Fortune and Wealth

14:57.840 --> 15:00.200
(Crown Princess)
from the Commander of Xiling.

15:00.520 --> 15:02.380
It's most auspicious.

15:02.400 --> 15:03.920
You probably forgot

15:04.000 --> 15:04.960
we had given her

15:04.960 --> 15:06.760
that gift three years ago.

15:07.560 --> 15:09.000
It's too perfunctory.

15:13.350 --> 15:14.280
Nothing is perfect.

15:14.280 --> 15:15.720
Take them away.

15:19.640 --> 15:21.060
Your Highness,

15:21.080 --> 15:22.980
it's just a birthday gift.

15:23.000 --> 15:24.340
If you don't like those,

15:24.360 --> 15:26.020
I'll prepare something else.

15:26.040 --> 15:27.500
Don't worry too much.

15:27.520 --> 15:29.060
Don't worry?

15:29.080 --> 15:30.260
Ever since Mother left,

15:30.280 --> 15:31.520
how many times has Consort Xian

15:31.520 --> 15:32.940
set me up

15:32.960 --> 15:35.340
to bring me down for her son, Zhang?

15:35.360 --> 15:36.860
Have you forgotten all that?

15:36.880 --> 15:38.680
I wouldn't dare.

15:39.560 --> 15:41.380
You're allergic to walnuts,

15:41.400 --> 15:42.400
but she once

15:42.400 --> 15:44.100
slipped chopped walnuts

15:44.120 --> 15:45.340
into your desserts,

15:45.360 --> 15:47.300
which almost killed you.

15:47.320 --> 15:49.180
Grand Princess saved your life

15:49.200 --> 15:50.360
and told His Majesty about it

15:50.360 --> 15:51.820
to have Consort Xian punished.

15:51.840 --> 15:53.360
Indeed!

15:53.760 --> 15:56.020
Despite the past between her and Mother,

15:56.040 --> 15:58.440
she helped me keep my post.

15:58.680 --> 15:59.900
Over the years,

15:59.920 --> 16:01.540
Zhang's never stopped fighting me

16:01.560 --> 16:03.220
but he's never won.

16:03.240 --> 16:04.420
Why?

16:04.440 --> 16:06.080
Because I have

16:06.080 --> 16:08.200
Aunt's full support!

16:11.560 --> 16:13.100
You're right, Your Highness.

16:13.120 --> 16:15.640
I'll always remember that.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.880
Your Highness,

16:18.000 --> 16:19.090
the Grand Princess said

16:19.090 --> 16:20.120
there'd be no banquet

16:20.120 --> 16:21.460
for her birthday this year.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.920
No banquet?

16:23.360 --> 16:25.320
It was held every year.

16:26.840 --> 16:28.320
Her mood must've been spoiled

16:28.320 --> 16:30.020
by Mingyue.

16:30.040 --> 16:31.520
It's Jin's fault!

16:32.320 --> 16:33.470
In that case,

16:33.490 --> 16:34.360
Your Highness,

16:34.360 --> 16:36.960
do we still need to prepare a gift?

16:37.040 --> 16:38.940
Without the banquet,

16:38.960 --> 16:42.040
the gift has to be even better!

16:43.080 --> 16:45.040
Never mind. I'll prepare it myself.

16:47.080 --> 16:49.520
He only remembers his aunt's birthday,

16:50.160 --> 16:51.660
but he's long forgotten

16:51.680 --> 16:53.520
the day his mother died.

16:55.920 --> 17:00.480
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

17:20.280 --> 17:22.080
Where's everyone?

17:22.160 --> 17:23.920
It's her birthday.

17:24.360 --> 17:25.800
Why is it so quiet?

17:26.720 --> 17:28.600
Her Highness is in the pavilion.

17:33.840 --> 17:35.280
Rongyang.

17:36.720 --> 17:38.100
Brother.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.240
Today is your birthday.

17:40.440 --> 17:43.240
Why are you drinking cold liquor here alone?

17:43.440 --> 17:44.620
Brother,

17:44.640 --> 17:45.760
to this day, only you

17:45.760 --> 17:48.080
still remember my birthday.

17:48.200 --> 17:49.640
Not just me.

17:50.000 --> 17:51.360
So do your husband,

17:51.360 --> 17:52.840
your daughter,

17:53.120 --> 17:55.360
and everyone else in this house.

17:58.360 --> 18:00.660
I've lost everything.

18:00.680 --> 18:02.320
Cui Xu left.

18:02.400 --> 18:04.960
Mingyue let me down.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.740
She threatened me

18:06.760 --> 18:09.360
with her life to marry a man.

18:09.400 --> 18:12.320
People only see my wealth and glory

18:12.320 --> 18:16.200
but not my sadness and loneliness inside.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.720
Here,

18:18.880 --> 18:20.320
Brother,

18:23.320 --> 18:24.840
let's drink.

18:38.040 --> 18:40.200
Do you remember this robe?

18:40.720 --> 18:42.520
Of course.

18:43.600 --> 18:45.200
Back then, you put on

18:45.400 --> 18:47.000
that robe to drive away

18:47.000 --> 18:48.540
Prince Yan's rebel forces.

18:48.720 --> 18:49.780
I seized

18:49.800 --> 18:51.400
the throne at the risk

18:51.400 --> 18:52.780
of your life.

18:52.800 --> 18:54.760
Without you,

18:55.440 --> 18:56.880
the one

18:57.080 --> 18:58.660
sitting in that chair now

18:58.680 --> 19:00.440
would be Prince Xiang.

19:00.560 --> 19:02.600
I've never regretted it,

19:03.760 --> 19:05.040
not even when he

19:05.040 --> 19:06.400
had me hung on the city wall

19:06.400 --> 19:07.700
for three days and nights.

19:07.720 --> 19:09.880
I've had no regrets whatsoever.

19:10.080 --> 19:11.560
I didn't do it for Dazhou

19:11.560 --> 19:12.940
or the throne

19:12.960 --> 19:15.640
but for you because you were

19:16.080 --> 19:18.720
my only brother and dearest family.

19:22.200 --> 19:23.640
Rongyang,

19:25.200 --> 19:26.640
in this world,

19:27.720 --> 19:30.320
only you truly care about me.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.800
You're my dearest family, too.

19:42.240 --> 19:44.120
I'll die for you

19:44.600 --> 19:48.080
with no regrets.

19:51.000 --> 19:52.220
- Stop!
- Stop!

19:52.240 --> 19:53.590
Who's inside?

19:53.610 --> 19:55.020
(Changning Palace)
I'm on a mission

19:55.020 --> 19:55.900
for the Empress.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.400
It's confidential.

20:00.880 --> 20:03.300
Your Highness, we're out.

20:03.320 --> 20:04.580
Please sit tight.

20:04.600 --> 20:05.950
The Empress didn't tell His Majesty

20:05.950 --> 20:07.300
that she let you hang out.

20:07.320 --> 20:08.780
She told me repeatedly

20:08.800 --> 20:11.060
to keep a low profile
and put your safety first.

20:11.080 --> 20:12.500
I know.

20:12.520 --> 20:14.840
Fried dough sticks. Want some?

20:15.200 --> 20:16.620
Here, Miss.

20:16.640 --> 20:18.080
Watch out.

20:18.800 --> 20:20.240
Look, Ms. Duo!

20:23.280 --> 20:24.160
Amazing!

20:24.160 --> 20:25.760
Good! Great!

20:25.760 --> 20:27.200
Careful.

20:28.120 --> 20:29.780
Hand-knitting amulets!

20:29.800 --> 20:31.060
Take a look!

20:31.080 --> 20:32.220
No!

20:32.240 --> 20:33.660
Don't prick your hand.

20:33.680 --> 20:35.740
For safety, fortune, and marriage.

20:35.760 --> 20:38.040
Which color do you prefer, Miss?

20:39.400 --> 20:41.280
- I like this one.
- Buy no one.

20:42.840 --> 20:44.240
Everything's poorly made

20:44.240 --> 20:46.120
and way beneath you.

20:46.520 --> 20:47.960
Let's go.

20:48.520 --> 20:51.120
Freshly made ice yuanzi.

20:51.360 --> 20:52.380
Come and take a look.

20:52.400 --> 20:53.600
(Cold Noodles)
Ice yuanzi!

20:53.600 --> 20:54.720
(Purple Perilla, Cold Bean)

20:54.720 --> 20:57.000
I want the Cream Curd,

20:57.280 --> 20:58.540
Snow Ice Yuanzi,

20:58.560 --> 21:00.320
- and...
- No.

21:02.000 --> 21:03.620
Street snacks aren't healthy.

21:03.640 --> 21:05.020
What if they

21:05.040 --> 21:06.300
give you diarrhea?

21:06.320 --> 21:07.980
I've been hanging out for so long.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.720
I'm hungry.

21:10.720 --> 21:12.180
Have some of these.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.880
We'll go back to have dinner.

21:29.040 --> 21:31.200
I'll fetch some hot water.

21:31.920 --> 21:33.460
Please wait for me inside.

21:59.480 --> 22:01.540
Is it the first time he's come to us?

22:01.560 --> 22:03.000
Yes.

22:03.320 --> 22:04.320
Where's he?

22:04.320 --> 22:06.360
There he is, Mr. Zhen.

22:07.760 --> 22:09.140
I, Zhen Heng...

22:09.160 --> 22:11.140
I know a kite that sounds.

22:11.160 --> 22:12.360
Even if you can't see it,

22:12.360 --> 22:14.520
you'll know where the kite goes.

22:19.440 --> 22:20.880
Mr. Zhen!

22:25.600 --> 22:27.070
What are you doing here?

22:42.160 --> 22:43.600
You...

22:44.240 --> 22:45.720
You can see now.

22:47.760 --> 22:48.940
Who cured

22:48.960 --> 22:50.400
your eye disease?

22:50.960 --> 22:53.240
It was Jiang Si.

22:55.040 --> 22:57.460
Did you come out alone?

22:57.480 --> 22:58.320
No.

22:58.320 --> 23:00.140
Ms. Duo escorted me.

23:00.160 --> 23:02.620
She went to get hot water.

23:02.640 --> 23:04.440
She'll be back soon.

23:04.680 --> 23:06.320
Hot water?

23:07.160 --> 23:09.480
She must've gone to the shops nearby.

23:10.120 --> 23:11.560
Guard.

23:11.640 --> 23:13.660
Help Her Highness find Ms. Duo.

23:13.680 --> 23:15.120
Yes.

23:18.200 --> 23:19.500
It's not safe to be alone.

23:19.520 --> 23:21.120
Your mother will be worried.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.640
How about

23:22.680 --> 23:24.360
I escort you back first?

23:28.360 --> 23:30.780
May I stay a bit longer?

23:30.800 --> 23:32.160
My mother finally

23:32.160 --> 23:33.740
let me out.

23:33.760 --> 23:36.080
I want to walk around

23:36.080 --> 23:37.660
and see as much as possible

23:37.880 --> 23:40.440
so that I can recall it

23:41.000 --> 23:44.120
when I get back to the Palace.

23:48.320 --> 23:50.180
Besides, I'm not alone.

23:50.200 --> 23:52.000
Aren't you here with me?

23:56.640 --> 23:58.060
Alright then.

23:58.080 --> 23:59.580
I'll take you to a place.

23:59.880 --> 24:01.320
Thanks, Master.

24:03.960 --> 24:05.640
Where are we?

24:05.840 --> 24:07.440
So many fish!

24:10.560 --> 24:12.000
Be careful, though.

24:16.520 --> 24:17.580
This is

24:17.600 --> 24:19.620
my secret place to relax.

24:19.640 --> 24:21.160
Whenever I become too tired,

24:21.160 --> 24:22.600
I'll come here.

24:23.360 --> 24:24.800
Look!

24:26.240 --> 24:27.680
Take a break from work

24:27.880 --> 24:29.800
and clear my head.

24:30.520 --> 24:32.330
Then go back to solve more cases.

24:32.560 --> 24:33.640
I thought

24:33.640 --> 24:35.520
you could do anything.

24:35.640 --> 24:38.320
Turns out, even you'll feel down sometimes.

24:40.720 --> 24:42.160
Of course.

24:45.240 --> 24:47.000
You know, everyone

24:47.320 --> 24:48.760
and everything

24:49.000 --> 24:50.480
has two sides:

24:51.040 --> 24:52.620
the bright one

24:52.640 --> 24:55.320
and the dark one.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.860
Now that you're free to come out,

25:00.880 --> 25:02.340
and your eyes are fine,

25:02.360 --> 25:04.700
you'll see all the good things

25:04.720 --> 25:06.240
in the world

25:06.480 --> 25:07.920
as well as

25:08.160 --> 25:11.160
those that aren't so good.

25:13.400 --> 25:14.840
Your Highness,

25:15.200 --> 25:16.840
when you see the latter,

25:16.920 --> 25:18.360
don't be afraid.

25:19.320 --> 25:20.880
I believe

25:21.280 --> 25:22.800
if you can

25:22.960 --> 25:24.740
get to the bottom of everything,

25:24.760 --> 25:26.320
it won't be a problem.

25:27.640 --> 25:29.080
Don't you agree?

25:32.080 --> 25:33.040
Others say

25:33.040 --> 25:35.900
you're stubborn and rigid,

25:35.920 --> 25:37.120
but it's not until now

25:37.120 --> 25:38.920
that I know more about you.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.880
You're determined to make

25:40.880 --> 25:42.620
this world a better place

25:42.640 --> 25:43.480
where everyone

25:43.480 --> 25:45.640
will live in bright light,

25:46.400 --> 25:48.540
so you have to be tough enough

25:48.560 --> 25:50.840
against darkness, right?

25:52.680 --> 25:54.120
To me,

25:55.240 --> 25:57.120
the law is the light

25:57.680 --> 26:01.080
to shine on justice and fight darkness.

26:12.320 --> 26:13.700
What are these?

26:13.720 --> 26:15.260
They're luminous!

26:15.280 --> 26:16.880
They're fireflies.

26:17.440 --> 26:19.560
It's said that when it's dark,

26:19.640 --> 26:22.040
they'll guide people through darkness.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.960
They use themselves

26:25.520 --> 26:27.200
to light up others.

26:42.920 --> 26:44.960
It stays in your hand.

26:45.080 --> 26:46.520
This is called

26:47.360 --> 26:50.720
your heart gets what it wants.

26:58.120 --> 26:59.560
Here you are.

27:00.320 --> 27:01.760
Try to hold it.

27:23.680 --> 27:25.900
Where did Mr. Zhen take Her Highness?

27:25.920 --> 27:27.320
The palace gates are about to close.

27:27.320 --> 27:28.880
Why isn't she back yet?

27:28.920 --> 27:30.360
Ms. Duo.

27:30.800 --> 27:32.240
Your Highness,

27:33.120 --> 27:34.880
there you are.

27:35.200 --> 27:37.020
We should thank Mr. Zhen.

27:37.040 --> 27:38.340
Thank you, sir.

27:38.360 --> 27:39.540
The gates will soon close.

27:39.560 --> 27:40.900
We have to go back.

27:40.920 --> 27:41.880
Sure.

27:41.880 --> 27:44.000
Thanks, Ms. Duo.

27:47.840 --> 27:49.440
Good night, Your Highness.

27:54.040 --> 27:54.960
Ms. Duo,

27:54.960 --> 27:55.960
what took you

27:55.960 --> 27:57.500
so long this afternoon?

27:57.520 --> 27:59.160
I waited and waited.

27:59.520 --> 28:01.460
I broke a ceramic bottle.

28:01.480 --> 28:03.380
The shop owner meant to rip me off

28:03.400 --> 28:04.860
and wouldn't let me go.

28:04.880 --> 28:06.920
Close the gate!

28:24.640 --> 28:28.080
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

28:34.960 --> 28:36.380
I'm surprised.

28:36.400 --> 28:37.320
No one but Prince Yan

28:37.320 --> 28:40.040
would suggest a rehearsal.

28:42.520 --> 28:44.280
The couple shall bow!

28:44.280 --> 28:45.760
Bow once.

28:48.360 --> 28:49.840
Bow again.

28:52.720 --> 28:54.160
Bow to each other.

28:56.640 --> 28:58.080
Rise.

28:59.070 --> 29:01.470
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

29:01.490 --> 29:05.150
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

29:05.170 --> 29:08.590
♪ Growing between us ♪

29:08.960 --> 29:11.640
Wash and dry your hands.

29:15.080 --> 29:18.860
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

29:18.880 --> 29:22.560
Be seated to share meat.

29:23.080 --> 29:24.820
♪ Like shadows ♪

29:24.840 --> 29:30.060
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

29:30.400 --> 29:34.720
Eat together to bring hearts together.

29:37.380 --> 29:39.160
♪ Time glows ♪

29:39.160 --> 29:43.810
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

29:44.320 --> 29:46.880
An imperial edict

29:49.640 --> 29:52.560
for Prince Yan, Yu Jin!

29:55.080 --> 29:56.360
"Prince Yan, Yu Jin,

29:56.360 --> 29:59.300
is virtuous, talented, and devoted.

29:59.320 --> 30:02.100
He's made great achievements as the head

30:02.120 --> 30:05.020
of the Chiyu Cavalry and Capital Security.

30:05.040 --> 30:07.060
Also, he's a filial son

30:07.080 --> 30:09.220
and a wonderful brother.

30:09.240 --> 30:10.880
Prince Yan didn't grow up in the Palace

30:10.880 --> 30:12.660
with me.

30:12.680 --> 30:14.540
I feel guilty about that.

30:14.560 --> 30:17.820
I've betrothed Jiang Si,
Earl Dongping's lineal daughter,

30:17.840 --> 30:19.840
to you as your wife,

30:19.960 --> 30:22.040
but the Jiang Clan is humble.

30:22.040 --> 30:23.720
Now, I've selected

30:23.720 --> 30:25.700
Grand Princess Rongyang's lineal daughter,

30:25.720 --> 30:27.220
Princess Mingyue,

30:27.240 --> 30:28.680
for you.

30:28.800 --> 30:31.620
She and Jiang Si are equals as your wives.

30:31.640 --> 30:34.000
They shall obey you."

30:34.760 --> 30:37.080
Please accept the edict.

30:42.680 --> 30:44.160
Long Dan, get my horse!

30:44.160 --> 30:45.600
Yes, Chief.

30:46.240 --> 30:47.680
Trust me.

30:48.040 --> 30:51.200
I'll marry you and you alone.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.880
Wait for me.

30:57.080 --> 30:59.240
Danger! He's breaking in!

31:02.680 --> 31:05.040
Beat the drum to alert all!

31:10.960 --> 31:13.080
Stand down. It's Prince Jin!

31:14.960 --> 31:17.200
Prince Jin has rushed through five gates

31:17.200 --> 31:19.340
(Tiande Hall)
to your hall, Your Majesty.

31:20.960 --> 31:22.320
(Zhengyang Gate)

31:23.920 --> 31:25.600
(Tiande Hall)

31:33.280 --> 31:34.840
Sorry, His Majesty's occupied.

31:34.840 --> 31:36.680
Please take this back, Father!

31:36.680 --> 31:38.680
Your Highness, an edict shows heaven's will.

31:38.680 --> 31:40.240
It can't be taken back!

31:40.240 --> 31:42.840
Please take this back, Father!

31:42.840 --> 31:44.780
It's a great honor for you

31:44.800 --> 31:46.680
to have two princesses together.

31:46.680 --> 31:52.080
Please take this back, Father!

31:52.080 --> 31:53.090
Your Highness!

31:53.110 --> 31:55.480
- Who summoned you?
- You can't say that!

31:59.080 --> 32:02.260
Please take this back, Father.

32:02.280 --> 32:04.480
You rushed through five gates.

32:04.560 --> 32:05.820
What do you think you're doing?

32:05.840 --> 32:07.280
No one has ever done that

32:07.280 --> 32:08.840
since Dazhou was founded.

32:08.840 --> 32:10.560
They're palace gates, not your doors.

32:10.560 --> 32:12.460
You can't go through them as you please!

32:12.480 --> 32:13.920
I was

32:14.240 --> 32:15.760
in a rush

32:16.720 --> 32:18.200
and forgot the rules.

32:18.640 --> 32:19.640
What you forgot

32:19.640 --> 32:21.300
is your identity.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.200
Do you still think

32:22.200 --> 32:23.820
you're Yu Qi in the South?

32:23.840 --> 32:24.640
Not anymore!

32:24.640 --> 32:26.580
You're a prince with a title!

32:26.600 --> 32:27.440
Officials are

32:27.440 --> 32:29.460
watching everything you say and do.

32:29.480 --> 32:30.660
If this matter gets out,

32:30.680 --> 32:31.840
what will they think of me?

32:31.840 --> 32:33.680
If I can't keep my own son in check,

32:33.680 --> 32:35.280
how can I rule a state?

32:40.880 --> 32:42.620
Look what you did.

32:42.640 --> 32:43.760
You broke through

32:43.760 --> 32:44.980
five palace gates

32:45.000 --> 32:46.900
simply because of your marriage.

32:46.920 --> 32:49.700
Others might think you meant to rebel!

32:49.720 --> 32:50.680
I wouldn't dare.

32:50.680 --> 32:53.800
Baoping, what's the penalty for his breach?

32:56.320 --> 32:57.760
Say it.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.880
Say it!

33:00.800 --> 33:02.020
Your Majesty,

33:02.040 --> 33:03.880
it's the death penalty on him

33:03.880 --> 33:05.200
and his entire clan!

33:05.200 --> 33:06.700
His entire clan, huh?

33:06.720 --> 33:07.900
Yu Jin,

33:07.920 --> 33:09.560
did you mean to have me killed, too?

33:09.560 --> 33:10.480
No, Father!

33:10.480 --> 33:11.940
I acted on impulse.

33:11.960 --> 33:14.840
Please retract the edict.

33:14.920 --> 33:16.200
Would you rather see Jiang Si

33:16.200 --> 33:17.640
die for you, too?

33:17.760 --> 33:19.200
Baoping,

33:20.000 --> 33:21.700
how many days are left until the wedding?

33:21.720 --> 33:23.060
Your Majesty,

33:23.080 --> 33:24.120
four days are left.

33:24.120 --> 33:25.000
I see.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.480
Wait four days

33:26.680 --> 33:28.200
and marry as planned!

33:28.760 --> 33:30.680
Father, Father, Father!

33:30.680 --> 33:32.080
Father, I can't!

33:32.080 --> 33:33.280
I won't marry Mingyue!

33:33.280 --> 33:35.440
Please retract the edict, Father...!

33:35.440 --> 33:37.760
- Let go, Your Highness!
- Please, Father!

33:37.760 --> 33:41.600
- Retract the edict!
- Your Highness, let go!

33:41.920 --> 33:43.360
Father,

33:44.240 --> 33:45.660
do you think

33:45.680 --> 33:48.240
you can force it on me?

33:48.480 --> 33:50.920
I'd rather die

33:50.960 --> 33:52.960
than marry her!

33:52.960 --> 33:54.880
You'd rather die?

33:56.000 --> 33:57.440
Fine.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.880
I'll grant it.

34:14.280 --> 34:15.160
I can be

34:15.160 --> 34:16.920
an idle prince.

34:17.560 --> 34:19.460
We'll close the gate

34:19.480 --> 34:21.560
and live our own life

34:21.600 --> 34:23.440
in peace at leisure.

34:26.520 --> 34:28.520
I fear our wish won't come true.

34:49.240 --> 34:50.680
Miss Si!

34:51.200 --> 34:52.140
What happened, Long Dan?

34:52.140 --> 34:52.920
What did you find?

34:52.920 --> 34:54.380
Chief broke through five palace gates

34:54.400 --> 34:55.820
to refuse the betrothal.

34:55.840 --> 34:56.940
Where is he now?

34:56.960 --> 34:58.780
He's kneeling in front of the Tiande Hall.

34:58.800 --> 35:00.830
He said he'd rather die than accept it.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.860
What did His Majesty say?

35:03.640 --> 35:05.080
He said

35:05.840 --> 35:07.480
he'd grant it.

35:08.960 --> 35:10.400
- Miss!
- Miss!

35:15.120 --> 35:18.640
(Peace and Prosperity)

35:19.440 --> 35:20.880
Your Majesty,

35:21.040 --> 35:23.400
I had the kitchen

35:23.400 --> 35:25.060
make your favorite dishes

35:25.080 --> 35:27.260
and other refreshing food.

35:27.280 --> 35:29.600
If you mean to speak for Yu Jin,

35:29.880 --> 35:31.800
don't bother.

35:33.000 --> 35:34.440
Let's eat.

35:39.560 --> 35:41.220
A banquet is going to be held.

35:41.240 --> 35:42.120
I'll make sure

35:42.120 --> 35:44.640
you're invited to it.

35:44.760 --> 35:46.060
At that banquet,

35:46.080 --> 35:47.440
I'll tell everyone

35:47.440 --> 35:48.860
in public

35:48.880 --> 35:51.060
that I'll marry you.

35:51.080 --> 35:53.080
I'll win at the banquet.

35:53.120 --> 35:54.760
Your love

35:55.520 --> 35:57.160
can only be me.

36:27.760 --> 36:29.200
Jin,

36:29.760 --> 36:31.800
why are you doing this?

36:35.240 --> 36:38.480
Mingyue is a Commandery Princess.

36:39.000 --> 36:40.560
She ends up as equal as the daughter

36:40.560 --> 36:42.460
of a humble earl to marry you.

36:42.480 --> 36:45.360
Do you know how much she's suffered?

36:46.120 --> 36:47.800
I didn't have Mingyue

36:47.800 --> 36:49.460
replace Jing Si

36:49.480 --> 36:52.360
but let her stay for your sake.

36:53.160 --> 36:54.120
Why can't you

36:54.120 --> 36:56.280
marry Mingyue

36:56.360 --> 36:58.540
for my sake in return?

36:58.560 --> 37:00.440
When you put it that,

37:00.880 --> 37:02.280
it was as if I begged Mingyue

37:02.280 --> 37:03.720
to marry me.

37:04.400 --> 37:05.440
Whether or not I'll marry,

37:05.440 --> 37:06.360
who I'll marry,

37:06.360 --> 37:08.080
that's my freedom.

37:08.200 --> 37:10.080
Don't make decisions for me, Aunt.

37:11.000 --> 37:13.940
Growing up in the wilderness

37:13.960 --> 37:16.080
you've always been wild.

37:17.160 --> 37:19.400
But I shall remind you

37:20.000 --> 37:22.280
that in the imperial clan,

37:22.960 --> 37:25.560
there's no such thing as freedom.

37:26.040 --> 37:27.840
We check and balance each other

37:27.840 --> 37:29.520
and follow orders.

37:30.000 --> 37:31.300
Even my brother,

37:31.320 --> 37:33.720
the Emperor, can't do as he wishes,

37:34.240 --> 37:36.840
let alone you, his son.

37:37.760 --> 37:39.360
That's the price you have to pay

37:39.360 --> 37:40.860
to indulge in

37:40.880 --> 37:43.560
a privileged life in Ling'an.

37:45.880 --> 37:48.360
You altered the divination.

37:48.760 --> 37:50.100
Who gave you that order?

37:50.120 --> 37:51.640
What nonsense is that?

37:51.820 --> 37:53.900
You had killed
Earl Dongping's wife with poison.

37:53.920 --> 37:56.080
Then you tried to do the same to Jiang Si.

37:56.200 --> 37:58.080
Whose order was that?

37:58.240 --> 37:59.760
There's only one person

37:59.760 --> 38:01.320
above you.

38:01.360 --> 38:03.680
Did my father order you to do so?

38:10.560 --> 38:14.520
Feel free to report me to him.

38:15.080 --> 38:16.900
Let's see if he trusts you

38:16.920 --> 38:18.800
or me.

38:20.440 --> 38:22.480
The wages of sin is death.

38:22.680 --> 38:24.120
That's your karma.

38:25.040 --> 38:27.000
Even my father can't shield you.

38:29.680 --> 38:30.900
Jin,

38:30.920 --> 38:32.460
once you're married,

38:32.480 --> 38:33.720
you and me

38:33.720 --> 38:36.320
will be bound together for good or ill.

38:36.400 --> 38:38.200
You're smart.

38:38.520 --> 38:40.240
Do what's right.

38:52.640 --> 38:53.560
It's raining.

38:53.560 --> 38:55.120
Go back to wait for him, Miss.

38:55.120 --> 38:56.340
I'll stay here.

38:56.360 --> 38:58.640
If anything happens, I'll let you know.

38:59.080 --> 39:00.960
He's kneeling in the Palace

39:01.720 --> 39:03.680
while I can't do anything

39:05.240 --> 39:06.680
but wait outside

39:06.720 --> 39:08.480
to keep him company.

39:10.650 --> 39:17.260
♪ As if in a dream, petals fall on the paper ♪

39:17.450 --> 39:20.870
♪ Looking back, everything is ♪

39:20.880 --> 39:24.280
♪ Difficult to untangle ♪

39:24.440 --> 39:30.490
♪ Forgetting the past, how many can make it ♪

39:31.170 --> 39:34.670
♪ Looking at the past ♪

39:34.670 --> 39:38.060
♪ There was dew on the mayfly ♪

39:38.080 --> 39:45.320
♪ In this lifetime,
I only want to be with you ♪

39:48.000 --> 39:52.640
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

39:52.640 --> 39:55.880
(Cixin Hall)
Fathers and sons make up overnight.

39:56.840 --> 39:58.200
Even though Prince Yan

39:58.200 --> 40:00.420
annoyed His Majesty,

40:00.440 --> 40:02.320
he's been punished.

40:02.320 --> 40:03.500
His Majesty won't

40:03.520 --> 40:05.820
stay mad at him tomorrow, right?

40:05.840 --> 40:06.940
Mother,

40:06.960 --> 40:09.780
it's not as easy as you think.

40:09.800 --> 40:11.680
Breaking into the Palace alone

40:11.680 --> 40:14.200
can cost him his life.

40:14.320 --> 40:15.540
Not to mention,

40:15.560 --> 40:17.800
he refused His Majesty's betrothal.

40:19.040 --> 40:20.560
Seek help from the officials

40:20.560 --> 40:21.880
who are still close to us.

40:21.880 --> 40:23.140
They can put in

40:23.160 --> 40:25.500
a good word for him with His Majesty.

40:25.520 --> 40:26.840
It's a highly sensitive matter.

40:26.840 --> 40:28.820
They can't wait to avoid it.

40:28.840 --> 40:30.780
Who'd help us?

40:30.800 --> 40:32.040
Anmou, what do you think

40:32.040 --> 40:34.120
we should do to help Prince Yan out?

40:34.120 --> 40:35.620
Did he really

40:35.640 --> 40:38.320
hit a dead end?

40:39.200 --> 40:40.540
Mother,

40:40.560 --> 40:42.880
it is now, indeed.

40:50.560 --> 40:52.000
What to do...?

40:52.960 --> 40:56.040
(Tiande Hall)

41:00.360 --> 41:02.120
Your Highness, you've been kneeling here

41:02.120 --> 41:04.140
for a day and a night without eating.

41:04.160 --> 41:05.360
If you keep it up,

41:05.360 --> 41:07.200
what if you collapse?

41:08.600 --> 41:10.600
Take a step back.

41:11.200 --> 41:12.400
The Grand Princess is

41:12.400 --> 41:13.880
His Majesty's closest sibling,

41:13.880 --> 41:15.300
and she guarded the state.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.760
She begged His Majesty with her life.

41:16.760 --> 41:17.680
That's why he betrothed

41:17.680 --> 41:19.440
her daughter to you.

41:19.760 --> 41:22.800
His Majesty had no choice.

41:23.520 --> 41:24.960
Eunuch Liu,

41:26.000 --> 41:27.480
say no more.

41:29.280 --> 41:31.640
Please think twice!

41:32.760 --> 41:36.640
(Tiande Hall)

41:40.320 --> 41:42.840
(Tiande Hall)

41:59.400 --> 42:00.840
- Si!
- Zhan!

42:00.840 --> 42:03.040
Have you heard anything?

42:03.600 --> 42:05.160
Go home first.

42:05.280 --> 42:07.240
He's still kneeling there.

42:07.520 --> 42:09.040
He is?

42:09.840 --> 42:11.280
So he's still alive.

42:11.320 --> 42:12.840
That's good.

42:37.880 --> 42:39.380
Gentlemen,

42:39.400 --> 42:41.800
do you have anything else to report?

42:49.400 --> 42:50.840
Your Majesty,

42:50.960 --> 42:54.000
I, Zhen Heng, request permission to speak.

43:00.920 --> 43:05.240
(The End of Episode 32)

43:05.731 --> 43:07.461
♪ From place to place ♪

43:07.461 --> 43:12.401
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:12.771 --> 43:15.151
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:15.151 --> 43:19.381
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:20.091 --> 43:22.491
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:22.511 --> 43:26.171
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:26.191 --> 43:29.611
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:29.761 --> 43:35.281
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:36.101 --> 43:39.781
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:39.781 --> 43:43.861
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:44.101 --> 43:45.841
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:45.861 --> 43:50.561
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:50.561 --> 43:54.131
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:54.151 --> 43:58.381
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:58.401 --> 44:00.181
♪ Time glows ♪

44:00.181 --> 44:04.721
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:04.741 --> 44:09.541
♪ And stars ♪

44:13.771 --> 44:16.301
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:16.321 --> 44:19.941
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:19.961 --> 44:23.391
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:23.411 --> 44:28.031
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:28.031 --> 44:31.721
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:31.741 --> 44:35.831
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:35.941 --> 44:37.761
♪ Time glows ♪

44:37.761 --> 44:42.311
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:42.331 --> 44:46.031
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:46.051 --> 44:50.211
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:50.391 --> 44:52.151
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:52.151 --> 44:56.671
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:56.671 --> 45:00.311
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

45:00.331 --> 45:06.001
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:07.691 --> 45:09.621
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:09.621 --> 45:17.121
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
